    "gp_section_623199205766267690": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "f2b12f8f0145f3786bf8443d88d89f824a4d34f54f63b27e1af590ad1aa83c3e_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gROAAvwMvJZtA_text": "<p><strong>🚫 0mg NMN, 0mg Urolithin A </strong>in your daily greens. AgeAura has both — at clinical dose.</p>",
        "gTGWPhXqmMjDD_text": "Why 90 Sprinkled Greens Will Never Out-Perform 3 Clinical Doses",
        "gemxlFYZIreey_label": "<p>Start Now <span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0);color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;\">→</span></p>",
        "ggIldgzWWCKDn_text": "<p>The leading green powders pack 75 to 90+ ingredients into one scoop — vitamins, minerals, adaptogens, pre-, pro- and post-biotics. They're an excellent foundation: basically a multivitamin in a nicer glass. But here's what none of them contain: NMN, Urolithin A, or a clinical 5,000mg dose of collagen. In other words — not one of the three compounds that actually intervene in how you age. A green powder fills the gaps in your diet. The AgeAura Pure Protocol targets the 3 mechanisms of aging — cellular energy, mitochondrial cleanup, and structural collagen — each at the full clinical dose, printed on the label. It's not a better green powder. It's the longevity layer your green powder doesn't have.</p>",
        "ggyylw4DRmx_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/0._Ltc_AAR_hero_image_45bf906a-cb64-4731-80d4-f5cd1fd2fe52.webp",
        "gigxiYRxBmtcQ_text": "<p><strong>🧬 Green powders = </strong>foundational nutrition. AgeAura = the 3 aging mechanisms.</p>",
        "gyLHaFDszPxkT_text": "<p>90-day money-back guarantee. No subscription required.</p>",
        "gymTAkLyfcjqH_text": "<p><strong>🔬 3 transparent compounds </strong>beat 90 fairy-dusted ones.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205766267690"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205766333226": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "389e58fde9dae690fdcc93576f8581965c6ad80b6faf9fe9537aad6808e9d294_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg6VEpVCanQ_label": "<p>Get the Protocol →</p>",
        "ggZLCEjNwI6_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\"><strong>Limited Offer:</strong></span> Get started with the AgeAura Pure Protocol</p>",
        "ggZnm2fhMr7_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/65_WNN_Main_Logo_eb77747f-0bd5-4316-a9ba-92349ddbe5cc.png",
