    "gp_section_623199205766398762": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "852d4d889f1312931a8aaf6eee0067244269e442423d80104609c34a387a5f69_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggV5awrmS_V_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/800x533?text=Image",
        "ggdJ8xYim_f_text": "<p>One protocol for all three fronts of aging — not one target at a time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most longevity routines hammer a single target — more NMN, another collagen scoop, one more antioxidant — while the rest of aging keeps advancing in the background. But aging isn't one failure. It runs on three fronts at once: your cellular energy production (NAD+), your mitochondrial cleanup, and your structural collagen — and each one accelerates the other two. That's why a stack aimed at just one of them never quite delivers. The AgeAura Pure Protocol is built to cover all three at the same time, with one compound engineered for each job — so nothing's left untreated, and nothing's quietly aging you while you're busy fixing something else.</p>",
        "ggfIUIWzkii_text": "<p>Reason 1 — The 3-Layer System: Stop Fixing One Thing While Two Others Age You</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205766398762"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205766464298": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "3e5762419234470483ef91f19f688477a53bc773eef3b80ccf74c21d30530337_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-gupuGiLI_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/800x533?text=Image",
        "ggZnvGk7lVM_text": "<p>Reason 2 — Pure Urolithin A (500mg): The Cellular Cleanup Your Body Forgets After 40</p>",
        "gguWDBsY1dU_text": "<p>Restart the mitophagy your cells stop doing — the one compound with a human trial.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Inside every cell is a recycling crew that clears out worn, damaged mitochondria — a process called mitophagy. After 40 it slows to a crawl, broken \"power plants\" pile up, and your energy and recovery quietly decline no matter what you take. Urolithin A restarts that cleanup, and it's the one longevity compound with a landmark human trial behind it (Singh, JAMA 2022: ~12% muscle strength at 16 weeks). It isn't a stimulant — you won't feel a buzz; you'll notice the recovery score on your watch finally moving, the soreness easing, the afternoon nap you stop needing. AgeAura gives you the exact 500mg clinical dose at 98%+ purity — the same the trials used — without the premium markup, and with a COA you can actually read.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205766464298"
    },
