    "gp_section_623199205783044906": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "431bc1688aed8ffdc7c7c850fe3df5d9386ebce6cc26ee4517012d44867f43be_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggBtQ2BCoue_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/800x533?text=Image",
        "ggj1nJtO8uY_text": "<p>The methyl donor most brands skip — built into the same capsule.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NMN is the precursor your body converts into NAD+, the fuel that powers cellular energy — but there's a catch almost nobody warns you about. NMN burns through your methyl groups as it works, which is exactly why so many people feel great for two or three weeks, then nothing… and some even start waking at 3am. The fix is a methyl donor called TMG, and most brands either skip it or make you buy it separately. AgeAura builds it into the same capsule — 200mg NMN paired with 100mg TMG — so your NAD+ support stays methyl-balanced and the steady, all-day energy actually holds instead of fading on you.</p>",
        "ggoTHZZ6ocR_text": "<p>Reason 3 — Pure NMN + TMG: NAD+ Energy That Doesn't Plateau At Week Three</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205783044906"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205799756586": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "86fe7c582dd925ac05babc5ca00156ac9f5c4908e0d5c6fae246e46b6445f8cb_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg5rNmKbQef_text": "<p>Clinical-dose collagen with the vitamin C it needs to actually rebuild.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's what the \"collagen does nothing\" crowd misses: collagen physically cannot be rebuilt without vitamin C — it's the cofactor your body requires — and most powders leave it out. AgeAura includes the full 5,000mg clinical dose of hydrolyzed collagen together with the vitamin C and hyaluronic acid it actually needs to work, in a completely flavorless stick that disappears into your morning coffee or matcha. No beef taste, no chalky scoop. Give it about six weeks and you'll notice it where it counts — nails that grow instead of split, knees that go quiet on the stairs, skin that bounces back — the kind of change other people comment on without you fishing for it.</p>",
        "ggV5ssFOkdf_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/800x533?text=Image",
        "ggstOLVwOjU_text": "<p>Reason 4 — Pure Longevity Peptides (5,000mg): Skin, Joints & Nails That Feel Like You Again</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205799756586"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205799822122": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "2cc64411e99e52f9abaed0baaf8672e00eab1f95ab45f4177fcb4288aca37d0f_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggGb_5xJ16__text": "<p>Reason 5 — Show Me The Doses: Every Milligram On The Label, A COA Every Batch</p>",
        "ggmfMqAqcmg_text": "<p>No proprietary blends. No fairy dust. No \"trust us.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If a supplement hides its doses inside a \"proprietary blend,\" it's hiding something — usually that the ingredient you care about is in there as a sprinkle, not a clinical dose. AgeAura does the opposite. Every milligram of every compound is printed on the label, and every single batch is verified by an independent third-party lab — tested for identity, potency and heavy metals — in a US cGMP facility. You can read the certificate before you ever swallow a capsule. For anyone who's been burned by a brand that wouldn't show its COA, this is the entire point.</p>",
        "ggpSy8wWRGW_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/800x533?text=Image"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205799822122"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205799887658": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "cb733454a231472cb9e1e70f14e5cee9cdfafed9682163b815b6e14e7f13fb1e_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggnTLpQxikg_text": "<p>Reason 6 — No Subscription Trap. 90 Days. Keep The Bottles.</p>",
        "gguUO3_CG0e_text": "<p>The opposite of the cancel-nightmare brands.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You've heard the horror stories — the brand you couldn't cancel, the auto-ship that arrived after you cancelled, the \"no refund\" email. AgeAura runs the opposite playbook. There's no forced subscription: you buy when you want to, full stop. And every protocol is backed by a 90-day money-back guarantee — if you don't feel a meaningful shift, email us for a full refund and keep the product. No restocking fees, no shipping empty boxes back at your expense. The only thing you actually risk is doing nothing.</p>",
        "ggvsz7WQVKp_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/800x533?text=Image"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205799887658"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205799953194": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "72affc667654e186d9e18bda186357eb94ddebf6b7af8b7dfc9b34cd967fc0d5_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggP58p7TSFQ_text": "<p>Reason 7 — One 30-Second Ritual Replaces The Whole Cabinet</p>",
        "ggYUBBPz3h8_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/800x533?text=Image",
        "ggz2hm6coqi_text": "<p>Two capsules and a stick. That's the morning.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No pill organizer, no nine-capsule count-out, no separate orders from three different brands, no standing at the counter wondering whether any of it is doing anything. The AgeAura Pure Protocol consolidates the three compounds that actually earn their place — at full clinical doses you can verify — into one simple ritual you'll genuinely keep up. Simpler than the cabinet. And, unlike the cabinet, you can explain in one sentence exactly what each piece is for.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205799953194"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205800018730": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "014ed42aa7d1ece38947ffc10d54da49d0ae645d37623161c3ea36de8b39f085_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg0imPH4f8x_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">A fair question — and the answer is about balance, not just size. NMN raises NAD+, but it also burns through your methyl groups as it works, which is exactly why big, unbalanced doses so often stop feeling like anything after a few weeks (and can disrupt your sleep). AgeAura pairs 200mg NMN with 100mg TMG — the methyl donor most brands skip — at a ratio built to keep that balance, so it keeps working instead of plateauing. We'd rather give you a clinically-conservative dose that holds than a megadose that fizzles by week three.</span></p>",
        "gg0pKIsFcYy_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Because \"separately\" means three orders, three brands to vet, three sets of unknown purity — and you'd still be missing the cofactors that make them work: the TMG that keeps NMN from plateauing, the vitamin C collagen needs to rebuild. The Protocol brings all three at full clinical dose, cofactors included, every milligram third-party verified, in one ritual — plus a 90-day money-back guarantee you'll never get on a cheap Amazon bottle. You're not paying for more powder. You're paying for the doses being real and the guesswork being gone.</span></p>",
        "gg1a5EQIeRB_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/21._Ltc_AAR_footer_image_e899d7f3-7542-4c3b-a546-5bf184a399b7.webp",
        "gg1a5EQIeRB_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://placehold.co/1088x1088?text=Image",
        "gg37qa2H3XO_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Every batch is manufactured in a US cGMP-registered facility and tested by an independent third-party lab for identity, potency and heavy metals before it ships — and the certificate is available for you to read. No proprietary blends, no mystery sourcing. Purity you can verify, not just trust.</span></p>",
        "gg6gKSwIgdP_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">It's the most repeated myth in the category. Specific collagen dipeptides (like Pro-Hyp) survive digestion and signal your body to rebuild — but only when the cofactor is present, because collagen physically cannot be synthesized without vitamin C, which most powders leave out. AgeAura's Longevity Peptides include the full 5,000mg dose plus the vitamin C and hyaluronic acid it actually needs to become collagen. That's the line between \"expensive pee\" and nails, joints and skin you can feel change.</span></p>",
        "ggAFLXgVwrb_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Thirty seconds, once a day. One Pure NMN + TMG capsule, one Pure Urolithin A capsule, and one flavorless Longevity Peptides stick stirred into your coffee, matcha or water. No shaker, no pill organizer, no 14-capsule morning.</span></p>",
        "ggC77MqxIcb_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">No. There's no forced subscription — you buy when you want to, full stop. No auto-ship that arrives after you've cancelled, no \"email us three times\" runaround. And every protocol is backed by a 90-day money-back guarantee: if it doesn't work for you, you get a full refund and keep the product. No restocking fees, no returns at your expense.</span></p>",
        "ggH9TD5KuYK_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">Two things. First, set the expectation: Urolithin A isn't a stimulant — it's structural. You won't feel a buzz; you'll notice the recovery score on your watch moving, the soreness easing, the nap you stop needing. It's the one longevity compound with a landmark human trial behind it (Singh, JAMA 2022: ~12% muscle strength at 16 weeks), and like that trial, it works quietly over months. Second — you don't have to take our word for it. If you don't feel a meaningful shift in 90 days, email us for a full refund and keep the product. The risk is entirely ours.</span></p>",
        "gga7q5YJjuo_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">They do different jobs. A greens powder or multivitamin fills the nutrient gaps in your diet — foundational nutrition. The Pure Protocol targets the three mechanisms of aging — cellular energy, mitochondrial cleanup, and structural collagen — which greens powders don't touch. Keep your greens if you love them; the Protocol stacks right on top as the longevity layer.</span></p>",
        "ggbIHI8nJ8Y_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:px;\">So are we. There's no blend to hide behind: every compound and every milligram is printed on the label — 200mg NMN, 100mg TMG, 500mg Urolithin A, 5,000mg collagen — and every batch is verified by an independent third-party lab. If a brand won't show you its COA, that tells you everything you need to know. We'll show you ours.</span></p>",
        "ggnqoYha09X_text": "FAQs",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Isn't 200mg of NMN underdosed? I've read about people taking a gram a day.</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Why is it $499 when I could buy Urolithin A, NMN and collagen separately for less?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Doesn't collagen just break down into amino acids and do nothing?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_3": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>What if I take it for three months and feel nothing?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_4": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>How do I know what's actually in it? I'm done with proprietary blends.</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_5": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Am I going to get trapped in a subscription I can't cancel?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_6": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Where is it made? I worry about heavy metals and \"made-in-China\" supplements.</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_7": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>Do I still need my greens powder or multivitamin?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggrQNK5Y_7B_childItem_8": "<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;\"><strong>How do I actually take it?</strong></span></p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205800018730"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205866865450": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "3943680bdda785e7d74c55f3538d7605e2c2736ad49a37d3b56560f62872ca66_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-2htmJd1e_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/2237x1678?text=Image",
        "gg-39XvAKNx_text": "<p>\"Three months on the Pure Protocol and I genuinely feel like all three layers woke up — skin is plumper, energy is steady, recovery is back. My only regret is not starting sooner.\"</p>",
        "gg3AK2MSIuI_text": "<p>\"I'd been buying from three different brands for over a year. Switching to the Protocol meant one box, one ritual — and within two months my partner asked what changed about my skin and energy.\"</p>",
        "gg8Th3pka0A_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/2237x1678?text=Image",
        "gg8bW0gpqWH_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/2237x1678?text=Image",
        "ggBUxQxxQGZ_text": "<p>✅ Marco R., 48 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggHwS4m7ic9_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FIX_SecA_Marco_R._48.webp?v=1781004375",
        "ggI0qw29XvR_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Fix_SecA_-_Ken_N._51.webp?v=1781004375",
        "ggNtbaUIrZR_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/2237x1678?text=Image",
        "ggQg6SCY4Av_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/FIX_SecA_Daniel_R._54.webp?v=1781004375",
        "ggUjopy9EuM_text": "<p>✅ Ken N., 51 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggVwrprK-qS_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/Fix_SecA_Catherine_F._56.webp?v=1781004375",
        "gg_gbsY4yho_text": "<p>\"At 47 I'd hit a wall — workouts dragged, recovery took forever, skin was looking tired. Eight weeks on the Protocol and I feel 20+ years younger and more myself than I have in a very long time.\"</p>",
        "ggaCcUFon82_text": "<p>✅ Maree S., 58 ★★★★★</p>",
        "gggReAlJmmR_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">★★★★★ FEEL THE DIFFERENCE</span></p>",
        "ggg_IAXwv2c_text": "<p>Real People. Real Protocols. Real 90 Days.</p>",
        "ggly9UT8KWO_text": "<p>\"At 54 I was already on NMN. Adding the Protocol's TMG, Urolithin A and Peptides in one box was the missing piece — within five weeks recovery between training sessions was noticeably faster.\"</p>",
        "ggmFwD69MAe_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://placehold.co/2237x1678?text=Image",
        "ggsR1xCBlwv_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/05._Ltc_AAR_SecA_Maree_S._58_ef9dd776-4fc6-437d-8693-69659f488827.webp",
        "ggt2rBDlzqZ_text": "<p>\"No more shaker, no more pill organiser, no more 4 separate subscriptions. The Protocol gives me the cellular support I was paying for across four other bottles. The cost savings alone is worth it.\"</p>",
        "ggw3Biy_fLS_text": "<p>✅ Catherine F., 56 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggzRvVR8CoW_text": "<p>✅ Daniel R., 54 ★★★★★</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-623199205866865450"
    },
    "gp_section_623199205866930986": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "52204244a7c57c5f8946c7223c14c169cfece5ddd7e934c5199f9f004b971043_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gIJVREupyJIuw_text": "<p>\"Zero Flavor, Real Results\"</p>",
        "gg0XgNJ89am_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/15._Ltc_AAR_SecB_-_JASMINE_R_460a23be-2219-4425-96d1-bd124be588c2.webp",
        "gg6OP3FvqDL_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/17._Ltc_AAR_SEC_B_Gary_C._befb0b75-c58c-4a8e-b3d6-5aa6027ec8ec.webp",
        "gg7XhvEi4Cz_text": "<p>No more shaker, no more pill organiser, no more 4 separate subscriptions. The Protocol gives me the cellular support I was paying for across four other bottles.</p>",
        "gg84j4dnWYC_text": "<p>If a company won't post a certificate, I don't bother anymore. This one prints every milligram on the label — and it's the first NMN I've taken that included the TMG the others were missing.</p>",
        "gg8JF86KfdE_text": "<p>Nine capsules before work — some mornings I just stared at the pile. I stopped everything once and noticed zero difference except the money I saved. Three compounds I can actually explain beats fourteen I couldn't.</p>",
        "gg9qBKd0WvZ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/16._Ltc_AAR_SecB_-_Seth_T._51_b3b2240f-07cf-4627-9987-e2c6473f91e2.webp",
        "ggA64kZDPk2_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/20._Ltc_AAR_SEC_B_-_Jason_B._1466029e-ad57-41b1-adab-0d3a32e1508e.webp",
        "ggC0YRHfETw_text": "<p>\"The Missing Piece I Was Already Paying For\"</p>",
        "ggDIztUNq36_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/14._Ltc_AAR_SecB_-YOLANDA_B_71c7b464-1d72-461c-815b-a465e50b2c20.webp",
        "ggFrSZLJwkE_text": "<p>✅ Alex T., 56 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggIWUO5j6KB_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/19._Ltc_AAR_Sec_B_-_Katty_F._56_f9d4017e-3e4f-49f9-97b4-58677941974b.webp",
        "ggK2C27ww49_text": "<p>✅ Gary C., 56 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggOJMfEaHZu_text": "<p>I'd been stacking NMN, Urolithin A and collagen from three different brands for over a year. Switching to the Protocol cut my morning ritual from 6 minutes to 30 seconds — and I'm sleeping deeper than I have in years.</p>",
        "ggQuSqV0nCw_text": "<p>My VO2 max sat stuck for two years. A few months in, the number's climbing, recovery between hard days is faster, and Urolithin A has ruined my afternoon naps — I just don't need them anymore.</p>",
        "ggXI_4rTl3P_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/18._Ltc_AAR_SEC_B_-_Alex_T._56_07dcb336-6143-403a-bbdb-051ccc9c9c4b.webp",
        "ggZQujEgX0W_text": "<p>\"From 6 Minutes To 30 Seconds\"</p>",
        "ggZ_B050-J8_text": "<p>\"The First Brand That Actually Showed Me The COA\"</p>",
        "ggaL_NWpooh_text": "<p>\"My Garmin Finally Moved\"</p>",
        "ggbGkTCgH7u_text": "<p>\"My Husband Noticed Before I Said A Word\"</p>",
        "ggfPqh2gBdA_text": "<p>Two months on Protocol and the morning stiffness is gone. My partner actually commented on my skin. I forget the peptide stick is in my matcha because it has zero flavor.</p>",
        "ggg-tRhWKdi_text": "<p>In an 800-user survey: 92% reported overall wellness improved within 60 days · 88% better energy &amp; afternoon focus · 87% visible skin, hair &amp; recovery by month 3*</p>",
        "gggpvdvjfjD_text": "<p>✅ Seth T., 56 ★★★★★</p>",
        "gggwjmLjrda_text": "<p>✅ Katty F., 56 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggi_WirsJML_text": "<p>✅ YOLANDA B. ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggmugokkcFf_text": "<p>✅ JASMINE R., 48 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggw5c7dBUpW_text": "<p>\"I Finally Threw Out The 8-Bottle Cabinet\"</p>",
        "ggxIo_rwPyT_text": "<p>✅ Jason B., 56 ★★★★★</p>",
        "ggyj40apyno_text": "<p>At 54 I felt like I was crumbling. Now my nails grow instead of split, my knees are quiet on the stairs, and he told me I was looking well — without me fishing for it. If men notice, it's working.</p>",
        "gqbfAGjagTtRV_text": "<span style=\"font-size:28px;\"><strong>4.9 / 5.0 — Trusted by 1M+ across the AgeAura family</strong></span>"
      },
